# GitHub fine-grained personal access token.
# Generate at: https://github.com/settings/tokens?type=beta
#
# Token type: Fine-grained personal access token
# Resource owner: your GitHub account
# Repository access: All repositories (or select the lunk repos explicitly)
#
# Required repository permissions:
#   Metadata:        read  (auto-granted; needed for repo visibility checks)
#   Administration:  read  (needed to read repo visibility in compliance check)
#
# If hub.py write operations are also needed (set_visibility, set_topics,
# archive, delete_branch), add: Administration: write, Contents: write
GITHUB_TOKEN=
